{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國前總統奧巴馬上周六（24日）在密歇根州和俄亥俄州，為中期選舉民主黨候選人助選，把選民最關切的物價飛漲問題，歸咎現任總統特朗普去年初重返白宮以來「連番作出錯誤決定」，尤其是「決定發動一場毫無必要、沒有人要求的戰爭」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.943004+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T09:41:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:11.465964+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536448+00:00","content_hash":"7150499bd3d43e2e0e5ab173d2680a818a21d386e34167ed168d7065a433000d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}